judgeRubric:
You are reviewing invoice data extracted from a document. Compare the actual answer with the expected answer.

Pass if:
- vendor and billTo name the same companies, ignoring case, punctuation, and legal suffixes such as Inc. or Co.;
- invoiceNumber, purchaseOrder, and date refer to the same values, even if formatted differently;
- every line item is present with the same quantity, unit price, and amount, in any order;
- subtotal, tax, and total match within one cent.

Fail if any value is missing, invented, or taken from the wrong part of the document (for example a remit-to address used as billTo).
